{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15117","headline":"合源溪期张计不至 · 李益","name":"合源溪期张计不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜露肃时序，缅然方独寻。\n暗溪迟仙侣，寒涧闻松禽。\n寂历兹夜永，清明秋序深。\n微波澹澄夕，烟景含虚林。\n素志久沦否，幽怀方自吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}